{"sections":[{"slug":"范畴对象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"范畴对象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴对象</span> (∞-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"范畴对象 (∞-范畴论)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一个范畴</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/内部观点","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内部</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴可由完备</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Segal空间","text":"Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">描述</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3>Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">首先我们重复</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Segal空间","text":"Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的定义</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">直观上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它是一些可复合的态射构成的结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">已经接近于范畴的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但还有差距</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的一个</span> <strong>Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X \\colon \\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足对任意</span> $m,n\\in\\mathbb{N}$, <span lang=\"zh\">下图为拉回</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">直观</span>: “<span lang=\"zh\">态射可复合</span>”).\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    X_{m+n} &amp; \\to &amp; X_m \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    X_n &amp; \\to &amp; X_0\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">该图来自</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"$\\Delta$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">中的如下交换图</span>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\{0 &lt; \\cdots &lt; m+n\\} &amp; \\leftarrow &amp; \\{0 &lt; \\cdots &lt; m\\} \\\\\r\n    \\uparrow &amp;&amp; \\uparrow \\\\\r\n    \\{m &lt; \\cdots &lt; m+n\\} &amp; \\leftarrow &amp; \\{m\\}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathsf{Segal}(\\mathcal C) \\hookrightarrow \\mathsf{Fun}(\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象在单纯对象中构成的全子范畴</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">完备</span> Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群胚对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群胚对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/AntieauCSO","text":"Antieau"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">可证明</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E∞-空间","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathsf{Ani})$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的范畴对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">事实上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">两者均为</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathsf{Fin}_*\\times\\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Ani})\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的全子范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">又由于函子范畴中的极限是逐点的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可验证两个子范畴相同</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}